      "statement": "codeLearning.js implements three-tier syntax learning: exact rules (batch-wide, revocable), context suggestions (neighbor patterns), and shape suggestions (token morphology). Learning is entirely user-driven; the tool learns only from rows the user has touched, never from its own defaults.",
