      "statement": "etSeed.js proposes ElementTypes by guessing family with this precedence (first match wins): library (same product before), track (TRACK position), stem (shared code stem), style (prior naming), shape (shipped table), line (product lines), design (existing IsDesign), canon (Form semantics), parent (PositionType fallback). Nothing guessed from maker alone.",
